    T204
        title        P02 — Own runtime services, Clock, and actor lifetime
        status       done
        priority     high
        blocked_by   [@task.Rewrite.T202, @task.Rewrite.T203]
        derives_from [@plan.Runtime.D2, @plan.Runtime.C2, @plan.Runtime.V3, @plan.Runtime.V5]
        description
            Source Bead flow-state-e7p.13.2 (closed).
            Deliverable: make RuntimeOwner own provided services, readiness, runtime
            Scope, and actor lifetimes.
            Allowed paths: packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/runtime runtime owner,
            actor lifetime, and focused tests.
        acceptance
            - Readiness has one shared cold attempt and one cached terminal Exit;
              followers interrupt independently.
