              release joins the full child Exit.
            - Evidence: focused runtime and owner checks plus required reviewer
              receipts.

    T205
        title        P03 — Preserve cleanup ownership and full failure causes
        status       done
        priority     high
        blocked_by   [@task.Rewrite.T204]
        derives_from [
                     @plan.Runtime.D2,
                     @plan.Runtime.C2,
                     @plan.Runtime.V5,
