                     @plan.Diagnostics.V2
                     ]
        description
            Source Bead flow-state-e7p.13.3 (closed).
            Deliverable: preflight lifecycle release and preserve every cleanup
            Exit/Cause through ordered retries.
            Allowed paths: packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/runtime lifecycle, cleanup,
            and owner tests.
        acceptance
            - Fallible preflight completes before admission closes or resources
              release.
            - Cleanup visits every participant in reverse acquisition order and
              retries only failed explicit stages.
            - Typed failures, defects, interruptions, and cleanup failures remain
              observable; evidence records the source checks and reviews.
            - Evidence: lifecycle ordering proofs, scoped checks, and review receipts
              are recorded in the source Bead.

